        "chars": 383,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 16.48
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        376,
        800,
        1352,
        911
      ],
      "category": "List-item",
      "text": "(b) The members of the Council, other than the chairman, shall serve for a term of two years, except as follows. Two initial members of the Council, including one professional member and one public member, shall serve for a term ending December 31, 1979. Two initial members of the Council, including one professional member and one public member, shall serve for a term ending December 31, 1980.",
      "logprob_stats": {
