      "category": "List-item",
      "text": "\u00a7 3. *Purposes.* (a) The Council shall consider and advise the Mayor on matters concerning the establishment and operation of a unified City-wide emergency medical service system, including the Health and Hospitals Corporation (\"HHC\"), proprietary, voluntary and other health care providers, to ensure the effective and efficient provision of ambulance, paramedical, emergency room, back-up and other emergency medical services to the people of New York City.",
